{"synopsis":"Suatu hari, Seo Tae-pyung akhirnya bertransmigrasi sebagai adik dari tokoh utama wanita dalam novel romansa fantasi Celestial Love. Meski tempat ini seharusnya romantis, dia terlalu sibuk mencoba beradaptasi dengan kehidupan baruku.\n\nRomantis? Ya, benar! Tujuannya adalah untuk tetap rendah hati dan hidup tenang. Tapi kemudian…\n\n“Bagaimana mungkin kau membuat putri mahkota jatuh cinta padamu?!”\n\nPada saat itu, dia tidak tahu apa-apa. Dia baru saja mulai menguak permukaan dari rangkaian peristiwa aneh ini…","alternative_title":"로판에서 살아남기, Rofan-eseo Salanamgi","author":"Korita (코리타) ","artist":"Bread","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"7874c143-ad71-47d0-9744-60c649d694e0","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2025-08-13","released":"2025-08-13","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_ch_50/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"622ad591-c4e4-4c20-af66-b0c800e18710","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2025-08-13","released":"2025-08-13","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_b4c735a8-a5ed-4a9e-b7e6-839c10ac3d8d/chapter_c